
# Retail Analytics

An end-to-end retail data analytics and machine
learning project focused on understanding retail
profitability and business performance.

## Project Objectives

- Analyse real-world retail transaction data.
- Identify sales and revenue patterns.
- Investigate product and customer performance.
- Develop predictive machine learning models.
- Build interactive Power BI dashboards.
- Create a reproducible analytics pipeline.

## Technology Stack

- Python
- Pandas and NumPy
- SQL
- Scikit-learn
- Matplotlib and Seaborn
- Google Colab
- Power BI

## Project Structure

- data/: Dataset storage
- notebooks/: Analysis notebooks
- src/: Reusable Python modules
- sql/: SQL queries
- dashboard/: Power BI reports
- tests/: Automated tests
- reports/: Analytical reports

## Project Status

Under Development.
